All,

Thanks for the updates. A few decisions from today's standup:

1. We're going with the phased rollout: 10% -> 50% -> 100% over 3 hours
2. Bob will be primary on-call during cutover, Carol as backup
3. We'll keep the v1 endpoints running in read-only mode for 30 days
4. The deprecation notice goes out to external API consumers tomorrow

For the database migration, I confirmed with the DBA team:
  - The new indexes will be built concurrently (no table locks)
  - Estimated time for index creation: ~45 minutes on prod
  - We should start the migration 2 hours before the traffic cutover

Also, I noticed we don't have synthetic monitoring set up for v2 yet.
Bob, can you add the health check endpoints to our Datadog monitors?

- Alice

